{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">CAPS function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":2879,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309016","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/CAPS-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/CAPS-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"CAPS-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">CAPS function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Converts any lowercase characters in a CHARACTER or LONGCHAR expression to\n        uppercase characters, and returns the result. The data type of the returned value matches\n        the data type of the expression passed to the function.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CAPS-function__syntax_GC15662680776\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d341593e101\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"CAPS-function__idGDF1X42662547\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>CAPS ( <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var> )</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">expression</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A constant, field name, variable name, or expression that results\nin a CHARACTER or LONGCHAR value.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CAPS-function__example_GC15672680783\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d341593e145\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">In\nthe following code example, the CAPS function converts the characters in\nthe state field to uppercase:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-caps.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"CAPS-function__idGDF1X62662553\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>REPEAT:\n  PROMPT-FOR Customer.CustNum.\n  FIND Customer USING Customer.CustNum.\n  UPDATE Customer.Name Customer.Address Customer.City Customer.State.\n  Customer.State = <strong class=\"ph b\">CAPS(Customer.State).</strong>\n  DISPLAY Customer.State.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CAPS-function__notes_GC15682680789\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d341593e183\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">The\nCAPS function returns uppercase characters relative to the settings\nof the Internal Code Page (<code class=\"ph codeph\">-cpinternal</code>) and Case\nTable (<code class=\"ph codeph\">-cpcase</code>) startup parameters. For more information\non these parameters, see <cite class=\"cite\">OpenEdge Deployment: Startup Command\nand Parameter Reference</cite>.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">The CAPS function is double-byte enabled. The specified expression can\nyield a string containing double-byte characters; however, the CAPS function\nchanges only single-byte characters in the string.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CAPS-function__see-also_GC15692680797\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d341593e207\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"LC-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/LC-function.html#LC-function\">LC function</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CAN-SET-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CAN-SET-function.html\">CAN-SET function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CASE-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CASE-statement.html\">CASE statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309016","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":2879,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"CAPS function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CAPS-function.html","type":"Manual"}